[8.578, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?25h\u001b[2F\r\n\u001b[J\u001b[?1h\u001b=\u001b[?1h\u001b=RESEARCHER NOTES:\r\n - Standard deliveries are promised within a 2-hour window (kestrel_customer_service_policy#0)\r\n- If a delivery arrives more than 20 minutes after the end of its window, the customer receives a refund of 50% of the delivery fee (kestrel_customer_service_policy#0)\r\n- If the payload is lost (incident code KX-2), the customer receives a full refund plus a EUR 15 voucher (kestrel_customer_service_policy#0)\r\n- The parcel arrived 41 minutes after the end of its Standard window in Incident Review Q3 2026 (Incident 1 - Mannheim) (kestrel_incident_review_q3_2026#0)\r\n- The late arrival was due to the drone being grounded mid-route after a lightning strike and the 15/30 rule was applied (kestrel_incident_review_q3_2026#0)\r\n- Refunds are issued automatically within 5 business days "]
[8.578, "o", "(kestrel_customer_service_ \r\n\r\nWRITER:\r\n Sorry your Standard delivery arrived 41 minutes after the end of its 2-hour window. Because it was more than 20 minutes late, you’re eligible for a 50% refund of the delivery fee, which is issued automatically within 5 business days. The delay was caused by the drone being grounded mid-route due to a lightning strike, with the 15/30 rule a"]
